<title>UK: Barings Asset Management appoints UK equity head.</title>
<headline>Barings Asset Management appoints UK equity head.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barings Asset Management (BAM) said on Friday it has appointed Christopher Poil as deputy head of its UK equity team.</p>
<p>Poil previously worked for Mercury Asset Management as a divisional director and has a strong track record as a UK stock picker, BAM said in a statement released in London. The appointment takes effect on January 27. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 2734</p>
</text>
